Oracle components are not included
----------------------------------
This repository does not contain, and its releases must not contain, any
Oracle software, libraries (for example xdo-core.jar, xdoparser11g.jar,
xmlparserv2.jar, i18nAPI_v3.jar, orai18n*.jar), documentation, templates,
or other Oracle materials.

The optional local preview feature runs the Oracle BI Publisher rendering
engine from an Oracle installation that each user provides. The
`bun run oracle:import` script copies those libraries from the user's own
Oracle Home into a folder on the user's machine. Each user is solely
responsible for holding a valid Oracle license for that installation and
for complying with Oracle's license terms. The Apache License of this
project does not apply to, and grants no rights in, Oracle software.

The BI Publisher RTF template syntax supported by this project
(<?for-each?>, <?if?>, <?choose?>, form-field Help Text, and similar) is
implemented from Oracle's public documentation and from observing the
behavior of templates and outputs, without copying Oracle source code.

